===Noun===
{{en-noun|Maori|Maoris|Maories|pl3qual=obsolete}}

# A member of the indigenous people of [[New Zealand]].

====Usage notes====
* The plural {{m|en|Maori}} is now typically preferred, as the term is invariant in Māori.
* The form {{m|en|Māori}} (with a macron) is preferred by some New Zealanders as a more accurate reflection of the Maori self-designation (even when an Anglicised pronunciation is used). A double vowel is occasionally used instead of a macron; this was formerly more common, but has fallen out of use since the {{w|Māori Language Commission}}'s decision to adopt the macron as the standard representation of Māori long vowels.

